# Autoeight V2 — Windsurf Rules

## Project
Static HTML/CSS/JS website for Autoeight, an AI and automation agency in Halifax, West Yorkshire. Hosted on GitHub Pages at autoeight.ai. No frameworks, no build tools.

## Stack
- HTML5, CSS3, vanilla JavaScript
- Google Fonts (Inter 300-800), Font Awesome 6.5
- Single `style.css` (~160KB) and `main.js`
- GitHub Pages hosting with CNAME

## Code Style
- Semantic HTML with proper heading hierarchy (one H1 per page)
- CSS uses custom properties (--purple-light, --muted, --border, etc.)
- Class naming: lowercase hyphenated (e.g. `hero-content`, `blog-card`, `stat-bar`)
- JS uses vanilla DOM — no jQuery, no libraries
- British English in all copy (colour, optimise, analyse, personalise)
- Indent: 2 spaces for HTML/CSS/JS

## Tone of Voice
Direct, conversational, human. Use contractions. Short sentences.
- Never use: "comprehensive", "streamlined", "leveraging", "robust", "holistic", "empower", "bespoke", "cutting-edge", "seamlessly"
- Use instead: "built", "set up", "sorted", "handles", "takes care of", "plugged in"

## SEO (Critical)
Every page requires:
- Title tag with "Halifax" or "West Yorkshire"
- Meta description with location keywords
- Meta keywords, author ("Autoeight"), robots ("index, follow")
- Canonical URL, Open Graph tags, Twitter Card tags
- JSON-LD schema with areaServed array: Halifax, Leeds, Bradford, Huddersfield, West Yorkshire, UK
- BreadcrumbList schema on service pages
- Target terms: "AI automation Halifax", "AI companies Halifax", "AI companies Leeds", "automation agency West Yorkshire"

## Structure
- Services: `services/*.html` (7 pages)
- Blog/news: `resources/blog-*.html` (external article cards on `resources/blog.html`)
- Blueprints: `resources/blueprint-*.html`
- Case studies: `brand_assets/case-studies/{client}/{slug}.html`
- Admin: `backend/*.html` (blocked from indexing)

## Rules
1. No frameworks, CMS, templates, or build tools
2. Nav dropdown + footer must include all 7 services (including system-integration)
3. External links: `target="_blank" rel="noopener"`
4. Images in `brand_assets/`
5. Update `sitemap.xml` when adding pages
6. Match existing design patterns (page-hero, page-section, blog-card, tier-card, etc.)
7. Never commit `.env` or credentials
